<Slide style={{ padding: '32px 60px', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'column',
    width: '100%',
    height: '100%',
    gap: 16,
  }}>
    {/* 页眉 */}
    <Box style={{
      flexDirection: 'row',
      alignItems: 'center',
      justifyContent: 'space-between',
      height: 40,
      borderBottom: '2px solid #1E4FA8',
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>定性结果</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>Qualitative Results</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* 图片 */}
    <Box style={{
      flexDirection: 'column',
      alignItems: 'center',
      gap: 8,
    }}>
      <Image
        src="C:/Users/LYX10/Downloads/Typora/牛只数据集/cdod_icpr_ppt/assets/fig4_qualitative_cases.png"
        style={{
          width: 1000,
          height: 333,
          objectFit: 'contain',
          border: '1px solid #D6DCE5',
          borderRadius: 8,
        }}
      />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', textAlign: 'center' }}>
        Fig.4 跨域检测典型案例：绿色为 GT，红色为预测。从左到右包含成功、失败、夜间/眩光等极端条件。
      </Text>
    </Box>
    {/* 失败模式总结 */}
    <Box style={{
      flexDirection: 'row',
      gap: 16,
      flex: 1,
    }}>
      {[
        { title: '大域偏移退化', desc: '夜间、眩光、雨雪等条件下检测器严重掉点' },
        { title: '遮挡与背景 clutter', desc: '重叠物体或杂乱背景导致误检/漏检' },
        { title: '分布内最稳', desc: 'COCO→COCO、Cityscapes→Cityscapes 始终最可靠' },
        { title: '特定场景脆弱', desc: 'agnostic→specific 在恶劣视觉条件下性能悬崖式下降' },
      ].map((item, idx) => (
        <Box key={idx} style={{
          flex: 1,
          background: '#F0F5FC',
          borderRadius: 8,
          padding: 14,
          gap: 8,
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>{item.title}</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{item.desc}</Text>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>